  f"{CEN['carriers_by_number_of_Z2_odd_faces (classes 1, 3, 5)']['6']} with six); {CEN['share_of_defect_carriers_flat_in_Z2'] * 100:.2f} percent of the carriers with defects "
  f"({CEN['share_with_defects_but_flat_in_Z2 (invisible to the working register)'] * 100:.2f} percent of all) hold only classes 2 and 4 and are flat for the working register. "
  f"Odd faces per carrier: {CEN['Z2_odd_faces_per_carrier']}, of which class 3: {CEN['of_which_class_3']}.")
